  "prefLabel": "Plc 1105.07 Renewal Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1105.07 Renewal Licenses.\n\n(a) The OPLC shall issue renewal licenses in accordance with Plc 308.13(a).\n\n(b) Renewal licenses shall be valid as provided in Plc 308.13(b).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1100) #13391, eff 5-27-22; ss by #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36 (formerly Plc 1105.03)",
